{"page":416,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"410","words":[{"text":"410","x":179,"y":134,"width":81,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER06 • 링크 계층. 링크, 접속망, 랜","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER06","x":575,"y":140,"width":167,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":774,"y":146,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"링크","x":820,"y":141,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"계층.","x":882,"y":140,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"링크,","x":956,"y":141,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"접속망,","x":1032,"y":139,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"랜","x":1133,"y":140,"width":25,"height":28}]},{"text":"단일 패리티 비트의 경우에는 수신자의 동작도 단순하다. 수신지는 수신된 d + 1","words":[{"text":"단일","x":616,"y":268,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"패리티","x":697,"y":266,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"비트의","x":810,"y":266,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"경우에는","x":924,"y":266,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"수신자의","x":1067,"y":265,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"동작도","x":1216,"y":265,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"단순하다.","x":1335,"y":264,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"수신지는","x":1501,"y":264,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"수신된","x":1659,"y":263,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"d","x":1778,"y":268,"width":20,"height":29},{"text":"+","x":1814,"y":272,"width":22,"height":25},{"text":"1","x":1855,"y":273,"width":8,"height":29}]},{"text":"개의 비트들에서 1의 개수를 계산하면 된다. 만일 짝수 패리티 기법에서 1의 값을 가","words":[{"text":"개의","x":552,"y":327,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"비트들에서","x":633,"y":325,"width":161,"height":39},{"text":"1의","x":816,"y":325,"width":45,"height":37},{"text":"개수를","x":881,"y":325,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"계산하면","x":995,"y":325,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":1142,"y":326,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"만일","x":1235,"y":326,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"짝수","x":1320,"y":325,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"패리티","x":1406,"y":325,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"기법에서","x":1531,"y":324,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"1의","x":1693,"y":324,"width":48,"height":39},{"text":"값을","x":1761,"y":324,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"가","x":1839,"y":328,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"진 비트가 홀수 개라면, 수신지는 최소한 하나의 비트 오류가 있음을 알게 된다. 더 정","words":[{"text":"진","x":551,"y":386,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"비트가","x":596,"y":386,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"홀수","x":709,"y":385,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"개라면,","x":790,"y":384,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"수신지는","x":910,"y":385,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"최소한","x":1058,"y":386,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":1171,"y":386,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"비트","x":1290,"y":386,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"오류가","x":1372,"y":385,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"있음을","x":1496,"y":386,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"알게","x":1618,"y":385,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"된다.","x":1704,"y":385,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"더","x":1796,"y":385,"width":26,"height":37},{"text":"정","x":1841,"y":389,"width":23,"height":37}]},{"text":"확하 말하면, 수신지는 임의의 홀수 개의 비트 오류가 발생했음을 알 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"확하","x":547,"y":446,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"말하면,","x":627,"y":445,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"수신지는","x":747,"y":443,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"임의의","x":894,"y":445,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"홀수","x":1005,"y":446,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"개의","x":1081,"y":446,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"비트","x":1160,"y":446,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"오류가","x":1239,"y":446,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"발생했음을","x":1357,"y":445,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"알","x":1551,"y":446,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1598,"y":446,"width":37,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1650,"y":445,"width":77,"height":37}]},{"text":"그러나 짝수 개의 비트 오류가 발생하면 어떻게 될까? 이 경우에는 검출하지 못하","words":[{"text":"그러나","x":612,"y":504,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"짝수","x":725,"y":504,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"개의","x":806,"y":503,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"비트","x":884,"y":503,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"오류가","x":962,"y":504,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"발생하면","x":1076,"y":506,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"어떻게","x":1226,"y":506,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"될까?","x":1343,"y":505,"width":87,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1446,"y":505,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"경우에는","x":1497,"y":505,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"검출하지","x":1657,"y":506,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"못하","x":1806,"y":508,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"는 오류가 생길 수 있다. 만약에 비트 오류의 획률이 작고 오류가 비트마다 따로 발생","words":[{"text":"는","x":545,"y":567,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"오류가","x":593,"y":565,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"생길","x":708,"y":564,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":786,"y":564,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":835,"y":563,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"만약에","x":923,"y":563,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"비트","x":1040,"y":565,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"오류의","x":1118,"y":566,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"획률이","x":1235,"y":565,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"작고","x":1355,"y":566,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"오류가","x":1441,"y":566,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"비트마다","x":1568,"y":566,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"따로","x":1726,"y":567,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"발생","x":1807,"y":567,"width":58,"height":40}]},{"text":"한다고 가정할 수 있으면, 패킷 안에 다중 비트 오류가 있을 확률은 극히 작다. 이 경우","words":[{"text":"한다고","x":544,"y":625,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"가정할","x":658,"y":624,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":769,"y":624,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"있으면,","x":816,"y":622,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"패킷","x":936,"y":623,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"안에","x":1015,"y":624,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":1094,"y":625,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"비트","x":1176,"y":626,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"오류가","x":1256,"y":626,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"있을","x":1376,"y":626,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"확률은","x":1458,"y":626,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"극히","x":1581,"y":626,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"작다.","x":1667,"y":627,"width":79,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1763,"y":627,"width